# Maintainer: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>

# Eclipse Platform 4.41 (2026-09), UI layer: the bundles of
# github.com/eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform.ui (JFace, text, the e4
# workbench and its CSS theming, the 3.x workbench, IDE, editors, views,
# navigator, search, LTK, data binding), the UI bundles of
# github.com/eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform (debug, console, team, compare,
# net) and the org.eclipse.rcp branding bundle of
# github.com/eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform.releng.aggregator.
#
# The UI bundles of eclipse.platform are built here, after JFace and the
# workbench, because they depend on them; the rest of eclipse.platform is
# mingw-w64-eclipse-platform-core.  Bundles are compiled with javac from their
# MANIFEST.MF and build.properties (javabuild.sh's jb_bundle); OSGi
# Declarative Services descriptions are generated from the @Component
# annotations as PDE/bnd do.

